  "tines context list": "Usage: tines context list [options]

List context items (scope filters match every item whose scope includes the
element)

Options:
  -k, --kind <kind>             filter by kind: prompt, skill, or repo
  --exact                       only items whose scope sets exactly the given
                                dimensions
  -q, --search <text>           search names and descriptions
  -p, --project <name>          scope: project name or id
  -s, --state <workflow/state>  scope: workflow-qualified state
  -i, --issue <ref>             scope: issue (<project>/<number>)
  -l, --label <name>            scope: issue label name or id
  --limit <n>                   maximum items to return (page size under
