  help [command]  display help for command
",
  "tines events list": "Usage: tines events list [options]

List activity events, newest first

Options:
  -i, --issue <ref>     filter to one issue (<project>/<number>)
  -p, --project <name>  filter by project name or id
  -t, --type <type>     filter by event type (e.g. issue.transitioned)
  --limit <n>           maximum items to return (page size under --all-pages)
  --cursor <cursor>     resume from the next_cursor of a previous page
  --all-pages           fetch every page, not just the first (slower on large
