  "tines journal": "Usage: tines journal [options] [command]

An issue's stage journal: shared notes for its project + the stage your run was
launched in

Options:
  -h, --help                         display help for command

Commands:
  show [options] <ref>               Print the journal for the stage your run
                                     was launched in
  append [options] <ref> <markdown>  Append a lesson, creating the journal on
                                     first use — inline text, @file, or "-" to
                                     read stdin; escape a literal leading @ as
                                     @@
  rewrite [options] <ref>            Replace the journal body (to fix or prune
                                     entries) — version-checked
  help [command]                     display help for command
",
  "tines journal append": "Usage: tines journal append [options] <ref> <markdown>

Append a lesson, creating the journal on first use — inline text, @file, or "-"
