  "tines login": "Usage: tines login [options]

Store the API URL and key for this machine, so commands need no env vars

Options:
  -u, --url <url>  base URL of the Tines API to store (default
                   https://tines.tbuckley.dev)
  --api-key <key>  API key from Settings → API keys ("-" reads it from stdin)
  --no-verify      store without checking the key against the API
  -h, --help       display help for command
",
  "tines logout": "Usage: tines logout [options]

Forget the stored API URL and key

Options:
  -h, --help  display help for command
",
  "tines projects": "Usage: tines projects [options] [command]

Manage projects

Options:
  -h, --help                        display help for command

Commands:
  list [options]                    List projects
  create [options] <name>           Create a project (with its initial context
                                    prompt)
  show [options] <id-or-name>       Show a project
  edit [options] <id-or-name>       Edit a project
  archive [options] <id-or-name>    Archive a project: pause its schedules, stop
                                    dispatch, make its issues read-only
  unarchive [options] <id-or-name>  Unarchive a project: schedules resume from
                                    their next occurrence
  delete [options] <id-or-name>     Delete a project (refused while it still
                                    contains issues)
  help [command]                    display help for command
",
