  list [options]             List routing rules, most specific first
  set [options] <target...>  Create or replace the rule at a scope: an ordered
                             list of <runner>[:tier] targets
  clear [options]            Delete the rule at a scope (issues it matched stop
                             dispatching)
  help [command]             display help for command
