  "tines supervisor": "Usage: tines supervisor [options] [command]

The automation kill switch, quota policy, and attempt limit

Options:
  -h, --help         display help for command

Commands:
  status [options]   One-screen overview: kill switch, quota, utilization,
                     runners
  enable [options]   Arm automation (the kill switch on)
  disable [options]  Pause all automation at once (the kill switch off)
  quota              Pick and configure the quota policy
  help [command]     display help for command
",
