Use the per-state roster: at most N concurrent runs per workflow state

Options:
  --default <n>               limit for states without an override
  --state <workflow/state=n>  per-state override (repeatable), counted by the
                              state a run started in (default: [])
  -u, --url <url>             base URL of the Tines API (or set TINES_API_URL,
                              or run \`tines login\`; default
